  <History Date="22-05-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Terbly GLW370Z" />
  <History Date="28-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Added physical pan/tilt ranges." />
  <History Date="28-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed standard mode RGBW masters to default at zero." />
  <History Date="28-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Revised chase functions." />
